---
description: Safety and validation policy for every arch-bootc change
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` as the authoritative repository policy before
editing. Preserve its consent gates and treat host resources as persistent user
data. Do not run privileged linting, build an image, create or boot a VM, touch a
block device, publish anything, or clean up resources without the exact approval
required there.

Keep changes focused and preserve the rationale comments in `Containerfile`.
Never weaken the image's root-login protections, signature policy, daily pacman
cache bust, bootc provenance, or systemd enablement rules. Validate each affected
flavor independently when a build is authorized; otherwise report the missing
runtime evidence explicitly.
